  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a reader, I want selecting text not to turn the page, so that a drag on a selection does not lose my place.\n\nMac check of #460 (LOT-106, swipe page change), simulator, dev-swift 07b65784: with a text selection active, a drag still turned the page (4 to 5). A drag starting on a link neither opened it nor turned the page: unclear, to look at together.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] A drag with an active selection does not turn the page.\n- [ ] Link taps and spoilers are checked with swipe on.",
